The BOHOL blue snack and drink vending machine is a supplied design concept for packaged snacks, cans and bottles. The images show a bright blue graphic wrap, multiple product levels and payment hardware; final dimensions, channel layout, cooling, currency, terminal, software and product capacity must be confirmed with samples, the destination-market provider and the approved production drawing.

Buyers should send package dimensions, weights, target country, payment needs, branding files, estimated quantity and site conditions before BOHOL confirms the OEM/ODM scope.
